  "titulo": "Por (not para) to talk about speed",
  "subtitulo": "A 120 kilómetros por hora.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Use por (not para) for speed and rates: a 120 kilómetros por hora.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To talk about **speed**, _per hour_, use **por**: **a cien kilómetros por hora**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The speed itself goes with **a**: **iba a ochenta**, **a 120 por hora**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: on a speedometer, **por** sits between the distance and the hour."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Íbamos ==a== 120 kilómetros ==por== hora.",
              "en": "We were going 120 kilometers per hour."
            },
            {
              "es": "El barco navega a cuatro millas ==por== hora.",
              "en": "The boat sails at four miles per hour."
            },
            {
              "es": "No creo que esa moto corra a cien ==por== hora.",
              "en": "I don't think that motorcycle goes a hundred per hour."
            },
            {
              "es": "El viento sopla a treinta kilómetros ==por== hora.",
              "en": "The wind is blowing thirty kilometers per hour."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
